{"schemaVersion":1,"id":9,"sections":[{"id":"107010-PROLOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战前","scripts":[240],"start":0,"count":8},{"id":"107010-EPILOGUE","name":"第 1 战 · 战后","scripts":[10230],"start":8,"count":6},{"id":"107011-PROLOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战前","scripts":[250],"start":14,"count":10},{"id":"107011-EPILOGUE","name":"第 2 战 · 战后","scripts":[10240],"start":24,"count":6},{"id":"107012-PROLOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战前","scripts":[260],"start":30,"count":6},{"id":"107012-EPILOGUE","name":"第 3 战 · 战后","scripts":[10250],"start":36,"count":3},{"id":"107013-PROLOGUE","name":"第 4 战 · 战前","scripts":[270],"start":39,"count":9},{"id":"107013-EPILOGUE","name":"第 4 战 · 战后","scripts":[10260],"start":48,"count":6},{"id":"107014-PROLOGUE","name":"第 5 战 · 战前","scripts":[280],"start":54,"count":11},{"id":"107014-EPILOGUE","name":"第 5 战 · 战后","scripts":[10270],"start":65,"count":14}],"frames":[{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107010-PROLOGUE:240:2","scriptId":240,"text":"“好久不见，这次带来那只猩猩的消息，顺便又要一起执行任务了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":103,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107010-PROLOGUE:240:3","scriptId":240,"text":"“寒暄就省了，直入主题吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107010-PROLOGUE:240:4","scriptId":240,"text":"原来那只猩猩叫苏格拉底，是研究所的实验动物，和研究人员关系很亲密。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107010-PROLOGUE:240:5","scriptId":240,"text":"研究所被袭击以后失去主人的苏格拉底，并没有被肃清，可能是因为它是战车兽的关系。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107010-PROLOGUE:240:6","scriptId":240,"text":"根据苏格拉底的只言片语分析，攻陷研究所的真凶可能还在研究所，并且苏格拉底非常畏惧它。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107010-PROLOGUE:240:7","scriptId":240,"text":"“但是我们之前去的时候为什么没有发现异常呢？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107010-PROLOGUE:240:8","scriptId":240,"text":"“可能会说话的猩猩已经吸引掉了我们全部的注意力吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107010-PROLOGUE:240:9","scriptId":240,"text":"“好吧，只能再去跑一趟了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-066.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107010-EPILOGUE:10230:1","scriptId":10230,"text":"“上次没清理掉的外围战车兽，通过这次行动就一并清理掉了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":109,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107010-EPILOGUE:10230:2","scriptId":10230,"text":"“正因为这次准备充足，所以就一路碾过去了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":109,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107010-EPILOGUE:10230:3","scriptId":10230,"text":"“是啊，一个多月都没什么正式任务，手都痒了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":37,"right":109,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107010-EPILOGUE:10230:4","scriptId":10230,"text":"“那我们就比比谁干掉的战车兽多吧！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":37,"right":81,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107010-EPILOGUE:10230:5","scriptId":10230,"text":"“比就比，谁怕谁！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":37,"right":81,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107010-EPILOGUE:10230:6","scriptId":10230,"text":"“都收敛点……我们不是来春游的……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":37,"right":3,"section":1,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107011-PROLOGUE:250:2","scriptId":250,"text":"继续朝着研究所方向进军。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":37,"right":3,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":90,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-PROLOGUE:250:3","scriptId":250,"text":"“前方发现大量战车兽！个体是野牛型！我的炮弹被弹开了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":37,"right":90,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-PROLOGUE:250:4","scriptId":250,"text":"“野牛型！？资料里可是从来没出现过这种个体啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":103,"right":90,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":93,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-PROLOGUE:250:5","scriptId":250,"text":"“发动攻击！”普莉玛发出的炮弹呼啸着飞向野牛型战车兽的方向。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":103,"right":93,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-PROLOGUE:250:6","scriptId":250,"text":"“奈乐……我能问个问题吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":93,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-PROLOGUE:250:7","scriptId":250,"text":"“请说。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-PROLOGUE:250:8","scriptId":250,"text":"“你的队员都是那么随性的？？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":103,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":109,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-PROLOGUE:250:9","scriptId":250,"text":"“我相信队员们在战场上的判断。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":109,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-PROLOGUE:250:10","scriptId":250,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":109,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-PROLOGUE:250:11","scriptId":250,"text":"（一本正经的胡说八道啊，还是说她们强大到了如此自信的地步？）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":109,"section":2,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107011-EPILOGUE:10240:1","scriptId":10240,"text":"经过短暂的几轮攻击，野牛型战车兽纷纷被撂倒。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":83,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-EPILOGUE:10240:2","scriptId":10240,"text":"“轻松完成任务！敌方全灭。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":83,"right":109,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-EPILOGUE:10240:3","scriptId":10240,"text":"“我也干掉了一台敌人。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":83,"right":37,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-EPILOGUE:10240:4","scriptId":10240,"text":"“才一台，我可是干掉了三台啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":81,"right":37,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":98,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-EPILOGUE:10240:5","scriptId":10240,"text":"“……五台。”普莉玛小声的在一边嘟囔。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":81,"right":98,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107011-EPILOGUE:10240:6","scriptId":10240,"text":"(战斗能力超过了我的预期，就是非常不听话，算了……走一步看一步吧……）","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":3,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107012-PROLOGUE:260:2","scriptId":260,"text":"顺着野牛出现的方向，我们一步步推进，很快来到了研究所外的一块巨大的空地。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":81,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107012-PROLOGUE:260:3","scriptId":260,"text":"“野牛就是从这块地方出现的，但是很奇怪啊，这里什么都没有啊？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":81,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107012-PROLOGUE:260:4","scriptId":260,"text":"“把它们轰出来不就行了吗，真是笨。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":41,"right":81,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107012-PROLOGUE:260:5","scriptId":260,"text":"“这次我倒是很同意莉娜的观点，对着这块空地进行炮击。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":81,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107012-PROLOGUE:260:8","scriptId":260,"text":"经过一番轰炸，地面下传来了一股不明的震动。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":81,"section":4,"shake":true},{"kind":"dialogue","head":104,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107012-PROLOGUE:260:9","scriptId":260,"text":"“有东西来了！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":104,"right":81,"section":4,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107012-EPILOGUE:10250:1","scriptId":10250,"text":"与从地底大量涌出的战车兽交战了以后，终于成功的找到了一个突破口。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":104,"right":81,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":101,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107012-EPILOGUE:10250:2","scriptId":10250,"text":"“报告，从刚才交火处找到了一处通道！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":101,"right":81,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":109,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107012-EPILOGUE:10250:3","scriptId":10250,"text":"“干得漂亮！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":101,"right":109,"section":5,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107013-PROLOGUE:270:2","scriptId":270,"text":"进入那条通道，一路延伸到了一处密林。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":101,"right":109,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":31,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107013-PROLOGUE:270:3","scriptId":270,"text":"“这里和刚刚来的地方大不一样了啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":31,"right":109,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":90,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107013-PROLOGUE:270:4","scriptId":270,"text":"“当心点，佐伊，这里透着一股非常不妙的气息。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":31,"right":90,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107013-PROLOGUE:270:5","scriptId":270,"text":"“诶？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":41,"right":90,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107013-PROLOGUE:270:6","scriptId":270,"text":"除了佐伊，剩下的人都已经摆出一副临战态势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":41,"right":90,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107013-PROLOGUE:270:7","scriptId":270,"text":"“要来了！佐伊，瞄准3点钟方向！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":41,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107013-PROLOGUE:270:8","scriptId":270,"text":"“什么什么？已经要开打了！？”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107013-PROLOGUE:270:9","scriptId":270,"text":"话语间，一批战车兽，突然从树丛里窜了出来，速度之快让人咋舌。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107013-PROLOGUE:270:10","scriptId":270,"text":"“开火！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":6,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107013-EPILOGUE:10260:1","scriptId":10260,"text":"经过一场恶战，终于摆平了突袭而来的战车兽。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":41,"right":3,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":37,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107013-EPILOGUE:10260:2","scriptId":10260,"text":"“呼……不过如此嘛，大家都太大惊小怪了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":37,"right":3,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107013-EPILOGUE:10260:3","scriptId":10260,"text":"空气中传来一股异样的气息，压迫感十足，让人不禁冷汗直流。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":37,"right":3,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107013-EPILOGUE:10260:4","scriptId":10260,"text":"“看来刚才不过是开胃小菜，主菜登场了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107013-EPILOGUE:10260:5","scriptId":10260,"text":"树丛中矗立着一团灰白色的幽影，慢慢向众人靠近。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":3,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":53,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"107013-EPILOGUE:10260:6","scriptId":10260,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":7,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107014-PROLOGUE:280:2","scriptId":280,"text":"腿有点发软，在这人形怪物的面前，感觉空气都被凝固了，让人喘不过气来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":53,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"107014-PROLOGUE:280:3","scriptId":280,"text":"“闻起来挺不错的味道～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107014-PROLOGUE:280:4","scriptId":280,"text":"人形怪物突然迸出了一句人类的语言。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107014-PROLOGUE:280:5","scriptId":280,"text":"但在场的所有人都没有发出任何声音，仿佛再有什么事情发生也不会让人惊讶了。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":53,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"107014-PROLOGUE:280:6","scriptId":280,"text":"“都不说话么，真无聊～”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-PROLOGUE:280:7","scriptId":280,"text":"“全员开火！”我迅速下达了进攻指令。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107014-PROLOGUE:280:12","scriptId":280,"text":"一轮猛烈的炮击过后，硝烟正在慢慢散去。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":8,"shake":true},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107014-PROLOGUE:280:13","scriptId":280,"text":"人形怪物从硝烟中缓缓走出，不要说重创目标了，就连一点擦伤都没打出来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":53,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-009.webp","id":"107014-PROLOGUE:280:14","scriptId":280,"text":"“不打招呼就开火，真是不懂礼貌的家伙！”人形怪物摆出了一副攻击态势。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107014-PROLOGUE:280:15","scriptId":280,"text":"一旁的战车兽也不断的涌现出来。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-PROLOGUE:280:16","scriptId":280,"text":"“大家小心应战！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":8,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:1","scriptId":10270,"text":"战局非常不乐观，如果再拖延下去，全军覆没就只是时间问题。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:2","scriptId":10270,"text":"“后退！！”我迅速向奋战中的钢舞姬们发出了最简洁的命令。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:3","scriptId":10270,"text":"众人一路边战边退，连滚带爬，终于退到了来时的通道。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:4","scriptId":10270,"text":"待全员进入通道之后，奈乐下达了轰塌通道口的命令。","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:5","scriptId":10270,"text":"“呼……呼……呼……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:6","scriptId":10270,"text":"“继续以最大速度撤离，不要停下。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:7","scriptId":10270,"text":"一路退到齐格菲研究所外围，敌人并没有追上来，终于可以歇口气了","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":3,"right":53,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":106,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:8","scriptId":10270,"text":"“刚才我们的攻击完全没有对那个‘家伙’造成伤害。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":106,"right":53,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":84,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:9","scriptId":10270,"text":"“……好久没那么狼狈的逃跑了。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":106,"right":84,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":36,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:10","scriptId":10270,"text":"“腿还在发抖，太恐怖了……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":36,"right":84,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":3,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:11","scriptId":10270,"text":"“奈乐，这件事请以最快速度报告给隆美尔司令。”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":36,"right":3,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":103,"speaker":"奈乐·隆美尔","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:12","scriptId":10270,"text":"“恩，我现在就动身！莉娜和普莉玛，我们继续以最大速度直接返回总部！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":103,"right":3,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":92,"speaker":"普莉玛·派普","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:13","scriptId":10270,"text":"“是！”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":103,"right":92,"section":9,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":86,"speaker":"莉娜·托卢沙娅","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"107014-EPILOGUE:10270:14","scriptId":10270,"text":"“是……”","background":"/art/stories/zdbjbz-15.webp","left":103,"right":86,"section":9,"shake":false}],"summaries":["自奈乐带走猩猩以后过了一个多月，终于传回了消息，当然仍然是奈乐小队来传令。","野牛型战车兽？战车兽中不存在的个体啊。","都是什么情况啊！？哪里来得那么多稀奇古怪的生物？","不妙啊……那家伙全身散发着非常不妙的气息！"]}
